  title: Albuquerque
  author: GhostSalt
  description: "Well, to cut a long story short, he got away with my snorkel. But
    I made a solemn vow right then and there that I would not rest \u2014 I would
    not sleep for an instant \u2014 until the one-nostrilled man was brought to justice.
    But first, I decided to buy some donuts.\n\nDidn't expect to get this done on
    time, but I'm happy with how this turned out! Happy April Fool's day!\n\nand happy
    twitch plays support too i guess :sob:"
